# GitHub skips the review request when the code owner is the PR author, so this fires only when
# someone else opens a PR that touches these paths. Reviews are not required by the ruleset;
# this makes sure the request is made.

# CI, templates and these rules. A change here can weaken the checks that police every other PR.
